at that comes out to we have  let's see natural log of 2 divided by  0.05 and we're getting about thirteen  point nine years so I'm just going to  approximate it as fourteen years so that  would be your time to double if it's  compounded continuously at 5% so I hope  this video helped you to understand how  work with a perk for me a little bit  better and figuring out time to double  go ahead and subscribe to the channel  check out more math videos on my youtube  channel Mario's math tutoring and I look  forward to seeing in the future videos  I'll talk to you soon
 

